<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PAKISTAN, April 4 - Karachi - Vessels waiting off port - Two general cargo, first waiting for two days. One container waiting for two days. Two loaders, first waiting for eight days and two oil tankers, first waiting for three days.</p>
</text>
